# pbrSpheresExample  (example — 3d)
A TrussC example (runs in the web player).
APIs used: Material, plastic, gold, silver, mirror, Light, setWindowTitle, setDistance, enableMouseInput, createSphere, from, loadProcedural, setEnvironment, setDirectional, Vec3, setDiffuse, setIntensity, Color, setBaseColor, setRoughness, setMetallic, clear, EasyCam, rotate, begin, clearLights, setCameraPosition, getPosition, setMaterial, pushMatrix, translate, popMatrix, clearMaterial, setColor, drawBitmapString, Mesh, Environment

