A TrussC example.
APIs used: tell, ScreenRecorder, VideoWriter, stop, open, addFrame, VideoRecordSettings, VideoCodec, allocate, getWidth, getHeight, logNotice, size, pushMatrix, translate, rotate, getElapsedTimef, noFill, drawBox, popMatrix, begin, setColor, drawBitmapString, clear, close, isRecording, getFrameCount, keyPressed, start

