A usage example for the tcxVoronoi addon.
APIs used: pause, resume, random, keyPressed, Mesh, Color, Light, logNotice, setDirectional, Vec3, setAmbient, setDiffuse, setSpecular, createBox, build, from, clear, size, fromHSB, getElapsedTime, getWindowWidth, getWindowHeight, addLight, setCameraPosition, pushMatrix, translate, rotateY, rotateX, Material, plastic, setMaterial, popMatrix, clearMaterial, clearLights, setColor, drawBitmapString, toString

