# tcxImGui — Usage

```cpp
void tcApp::setup() {
    imguiSetup();
}

void tcApp::draw() {
    clear(0.1f, 0.1f, 0.1f);

    // Your TrussC drawing here...

    // ImGui frame
    imguiBegin();
