# tcxAzureKinectBodyTracking — Usage

```cpp
#include <tcxAzureKinect.h>
#include <tcxAzureKinectBodyTracking.h>
using namespace tcx;

AzureKinect cam;
BodyTracker tracker;

cam.setThreaded(false);            // body tracking shares the per-frame capture
